    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This set of MATLAB scripts serves as supplementary material for the paper titled \"Towards in vivo estimation of reaction kinetics using high-throughput metabolomics data: a maximum likelihood approach\" by W. Zhang, R. Kolte, and D. Dill. The instructions on how to run the scripts are in the readme.txt file. These scripts demonstrate an example on how to implement the method discussed in the paper of estimating kinetic parameters of multiple reactants/products reversible enzymatic reactions using maximum likelihood on data with relative errors.",
